#: ../../source/ansi-styles_readme.md:94
msgid ""
"By default, you get a map of styles, but the styles are also available as"
" groups. They are non-enumerable so they don't show up unless you access "
"them explicitly. This makes it easier to expose only a subset in a "
"higher-level module."
msgstr ""

