#: ../../source/ansi-styles_readme.md:106
msgid ""
"Raw escape codes (i.e. without the CSI escape prefix `\\u001B[` and "
"render mode postfix `m`) are available under `style.codes`, which returns"
" a `Map` with the open codes as keys and close codes as values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ansi-styles_readme.md:116
